    "text": "The National Associations of Sports Regulations, No. 01 of 2016 published in the Gazette ExtraordinaryNo. 1990/23 dated 27.10.2016, No. 2006/13 dated 13.02.2017, No. 2017/41 dated 05.05.2017, No. 2089/56 dated22.09.2018, No. 2093/39 dated 18.10.2018 and No. 2105/38 dated 10.01.2019 are hereby amended as follows :",
